Clawd is the mascot of Anthropic's Claude Code. "Claude" and "Clawd" and the
character design belong to Anthropic. This is an unofficial fan extension,
not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.

The built-in idle silhouette follows the publicly visible Clawd pixel design.
Rendering, PNG generation, sprite decoding and Agent-state playback code are
implemented in this project.

assets/official-sprites.json contains the official base-and-delta animation
catalogue extracted read-only from Claude macOS 6.6395.0's Clawd Quest engine.
That catalogue and the underlying character animation artwork belong to
Anthropic and are not relicensed under this project's MIT license. No GIF or
rasterized official animation bundle is included; official frames are decoded
and rasterized locally from that catalogue.

The MIT license covers this project's original code only, not Anthropic's
trademarks, character rights, or official animation data. See assets/README.md
for source and integrity information.
